<title>POLAND: Polish food prices flat in February 21-28.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices flat in February 21-28.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices were flat in the February 21-28 period after rising 0.1 percent in the previous 10 days, and were 0.1 percent higher than in the January 21-31 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				   FEB 21-28   FEB 11-20   LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.0	   0.1	  0.1 (0.4)</p>
<p> Bread				0.5	   0.3	  1.7 (1.6)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -0.4	  -0.5	 -1.9(-1.6)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	-0.3	  -0.1	 -0.6(-0.4)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.3	   0.4	  1.3 (1.8)</p>
<p> Eggs				-1.7	  -1.1	 -4.3(-2.9)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on February 20. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
